            "display_title": "This work proposes an adversarial training procedure for reducing disparity in fairness of regression tasks. The main contributions are theoretical bounding the disparity using distance between label populations and conditional distributions. The bounds are used to motivate the adversarial training cost function. Overall the paper is well written and motivated. Experimental results are reasonable. I have a few comments in the following for clarification below.",
